# concurrent_collectives_test.cm
#
# Stress for the merged per-(host, group) UecCollectiveSink: five collective
# operations run CONCURRENTLY on the SAME group {0,4,8,12}, so every member's
# single persistent sink holds several live entries in both op-state maps at
# once (mcast map: 2x allreduce descents + 1x bcast; reduce map: rooted-reduce
# result at host 0, reduce-scatter blocks at every member). Per-op flow ids
# isolate the operations within each map.
#
# Run with -bcast_mode mcast. Expect exactly 5 completion lines:
#   2x ALLREDUCE_COMPLETE, 1x REDUCE_COMPLETE, 1x REDUCE_SCATTER_COMPLETE,
#   1x BCAST_COMPLETE.
Nodes 16
Grp 0 4 8 12
Connections 5
0->0 id 1 start_allreduce 0 size 4096
0->0 id 2 start_allreduce 0 size 4096
0->0 id 3 start_reduce 0 size 4096
0->0 id 4 start_reduce_scatter 0 size 16384
0->0 id 5 start_bcast 0 size 4096
